From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:34:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: thermal: Add Apple S8003 temperature sensors
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Apple A9 (S8003) has six on-die temperature sensors in two register
pages: three in the power manager (SOC) and three in the CPU complex
(TCC). Describe both pages and number the sensors by hardware channel,
so that channels can be enabled later without changing the specifier.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux f5ce1082 (J71t ledger 13.1); description
 reworded to the hardware, unevaluatedProperties for the thermal-sensor
 reference.]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../bindings/thermal/apple,s8003-thermal.yaml | 62 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 62 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/apple,s8003-thermal.yaml

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/apple,s8003-thermal.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/apple,s8003-thermal.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..5bfd25b6b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/apple,s8003-thermal.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/thermal/apple,s8003-thermal.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: Apple S8003 on-die temperature sensors
+
+maintainers:
+  - Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+description: |
+  The Apple A9 (S8003) has three temperature sensors in the power manager
+  (SOC0 to SOC2) and three in the CPU complex (TCC0 to TCC2), called
+  "tempsensor,s8000" in the Apple device tree. The hardware converts with
+  the calibration the boot chain programs.
+
+  The sensor specifier is the channel: 0 to 2 select SOC0 to SOC2, 3 to 5
+  select TCC0 to TCC2.
+
+allOf:
+  - $ref: thermal-sensor.yaml#
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: apple,s8003-thermal
+
+  reg:
+    items:
+      - description: SOC sensor registers
+      - description: TCC sensor registers
+
+  reg-names:
+    items:
+      - const: soc
+      - const: tcc
+
+  '#thermal-sensor-cells':
+    const: 1
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - reg
+  - reg-names
+  - '#thermal-sensor-cells'
+
+unevaluatedProperties: false
+
+examples:
+  - |
+    soc {
+        #address-cells = <2>;
+        #size-cells = <2>;
+
+        thermal-sensor@20e0c0000 {
+            compatible = "apple,s8003-thermal";
+            reg = <0x2 0x0e0c0000 0x0 0x1000>,
+                  <0x2 0x02230000 0x0 0x1000>;
+            reg-names = "soc", "tcc";
+            #thermal-sensor-cells = <1>;
+        };
+    };
